75321>>>>>>>        
75321>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriver
75322>>>>>>>        If (sDriver <> "") Begin
75324>>>>>>>            Move (Repeat(" ", 8192)) to sOutConnStr
75325>>>>>>>            Call_Driver 0 sDRiver Function CLI_BROWSECONNECT Callback 0 Passing sInConnStr sOutConnStr iArg Result iRetval
