75490>>>>>External_Function WNetGetUserW "WNetGetUserW" MPR.DLL ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75491>>>>>
75491>>>>>// Wrapper Function WNetGetUser
75491>>>>>Function WNetGetUser Global ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75493>>>>>    
75493>>>>>    DWord   dwResult     
75493>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75493>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75493>>>>>        
75493>>>>>    Send StringToWide lpName (&uwName)
75494>>>>>    
75494>>>>>    Send WideSetBuffer lpUser_Name lpLength (&uwUserName)    
75495>>>>>    
75495>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (uwName.lpUText, uwUserName.lpUText, lpLength)) to dwResult
75496>>>>>    
75496>>>>>    Send WideToString (&uwUserName) lpUser_Name
75497>>>>>    
75497>>>>>    Function_Return dwResult
75498>>>>>End_Function
