75499>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
75499>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
75499>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
75501>>>>>    WString wName
75501>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
75501>>>>>    
75501>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
75502>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75503>>>>>    Move (ZeroString(iLength)) to wName
75504>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, AddressOf (wName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75505>>>>>    
75505>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
75507>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (wName))
75508>>>>>    End
75508>>>>>>
75508>>>>>    
75508>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
75509>>>>>End_Function
