75663>>>>>            If (hoWorkspace <> 0) Begin
75665>>>>>                Send EnumerateWorkspaceData of hoWorkspace Self (Refproc (AppendTextLn))
75666>>>>>                Send AppendTextLn ""
75667>>>>>            End
75667>>>>>>
75667>>>>>        End
75667>>>>>>
75667>>>>>    End_Procedure
